tion)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/39/Weapon_Dropped%21_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Weapon_Dropped%21_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/39/Weapon_Dropped%21_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Weapon_Dropped%21_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/39/Weapon_Dropped%21_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Weapon_Dropped%21_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Weapon Dropped!\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/39/Weapon_Dropped%21_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Weapon_Dropped%21_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/39/Weapon_Dropped%21_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Weapon_Dropped!_(Condition)\" title=\"Weapon Dropped! (Condition)\">Weapon Dropped!</a></strong><p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/38px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/50px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Duration Icons.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Duration: 1 turn</p>\n<div>\n<ul><li>An enemy has made you drop your weapon to the ground, similar to <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Disarmed_(Condition)\" title=\"Disarmed (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/41/Disarmed_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Disarmed_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/4/41/Disarmed_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Disarmed_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/4/41/Disarmed_Condition_Icon.webp/40px-Disarmed_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Disarmed\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/41/Disarmed_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Disarmed_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/41/Disarmed_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Disarmed_(Condition)\" title=\"Disarmed (Condition)\">Disarmed</a>.</li></ul>\n</div>\n </div>\n</div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>This spell is a variation of:<br>\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Exhort_the_Risen\" title=\"Exhort the Risen\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5e/Command_Halt_Undead_Icon.webp/40px-Command_Halt_Undead_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5e/Command_Halt_Undead_Icon.webp/60px-Command_Halt_Undead_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/5e/Command_Halt_Undead_Icon.webp/80px-Command_Halt_Undead_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Exhort the Risen\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5e/Command_Halt_Undead_Icon.webp/40px-Command_Halt_Undead_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/5e/Command_Halt_Undead_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Exhort_the_Risen\" title=\"Exhort the Risen\">Exhort the Risen</a></span>\n</p>\n</div>   \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260715054702\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.083 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.091 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 3077/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 47738/4194304 bytes\nT